  "When On, RHI will automatically configure ReShade when installing the ShortFuse DLSS addon:\n• Rename ReShade to Reshade64.asi\n• Install ASI Loader (winmm → version → dinput8)\n• Write HookStreamline=1 and HookDirectX=1 to reshade.ini\n\nThese steps are needed for FrameGen to work correctly after ReShade.\n\nNote: no longer required on ShortFuse DLSS addon v0.54 and above.": {
    "translation": "开启后，安装 ShortFuse DLSS 附加组件时，RHI 会自动配置 ReShade：\n• 将 ReShade 重命名为 Reshade64.asi\n• 安装 ASI Loader（winmm → version → dinput8）\n• 向 reshade.ini 写入 HookStreamline=1 和 HookDirectX=1\n\n这些步骤用于确保 ReShade 之后的帧生成能够正常工作。\n\n注意：ShortFuse DLSS 附加组件 v0.54 及以上版本已不再需要这些步骤。",
    "state": "reviewed",
    "source_hash": "c49621ad001a3835ae91faddbb0e7bb143d2603f2190a8002d824b8bd04a8bc2"
  },
